"description":"You’ve earned these benefits. Use your Medicare plan to get $0 grocery and health & wellness items, delivered to your door.\n\nMost Medicare Advantage plans come with OTC credits. Monthly money to spend on health items like vitamins, toothpaste, groceries, and more. Chapter makes it easy to claim and use those credits.\n\nDon't leave money on the table. Chapter's OTC Store is the easiest way to get wellness items covered by your Medicare plan, at no cost to you.\n\nWhat can I get?\n- Pain relief\n- Personal care (toothpaste, shampoo, lotion)\n- Vitamins & supplements\n- Cold & flu care\n- Groceries\n- And more, delivered to your door\n\nWho is this for?\nAnyone with a Medicare plan can use Chapter to make the most out of their plan and find ways to save money.\n\nHow it works:\n- Enter your Medicare plan\n- Shop eligible items\n- Confirm your shipping info\n- Get $0 items delivered\n\nWhy Chapter?\n- 87% of plans offer OTC credits—don’t leave them unused\n- Easy-to-use app, no calls or confusion\n- Trusted by tens of thousands of Medicare members\n\nIs it really free?\nYes. No extra fees, no catch.\n\nWhat are OTC credits?\nOTC credits are money your Medicare plan gives you to purchase wellness items like vitamins, sunscreen, and toothpaste.\n\nDo I have credits?\n87% of Medicare Advantage plans come with OTC credits. The Chapter App will tell you if you have the benefit, and how much, once you enter your plan information.", "averageUserRating":4.7037800000000000721911419532261788845062255859375, "trackCensoredName":"Chapter: Medicare OTC Store", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/chapter-medicare-otc-store/id6447076886?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "bundleId":"com.chapter.nightingale", "trackName":"Chapter: Medicare OTC Store", "genres":["Lifestyle"], "userRatingCount":2137}]
